! Executable OpenDSS entry deck for the three-step Daily QSTS case.
Redirect 4bus_dy.dss

New LoadShape.daily_load npts=3 interval=1 mult=(0.5 1.0 1.5) qmult=(0.5 1.0 1.5)
Edit Load.load1 daily=daily_load

Set VoltageBases=[12.47, 4.16]
CalcVoltageBases
Solve Mode=Daily Number=3 Step=1h ControlMode=Off
